# Copy to tests/winarm/.env (gitignored) to test on a Windows 11 ARM machine before a push:
# `go run ./tools/wincheck -arm64`, and `make pr-check` whenever this file names one.
#
# The machine is a VM on a Mac running VMware Fusion, both devices of one Pleiades project:
# PLEIADES_WINARM_PROJECT is that project's directory, PLEIADES_WINARM_DEVICE the Windows
# device in it (windows_server, reached over WinRM with its stored credential),
# PLEIADES_WINARM_VM_HOST the Mac (a generic_ssh device onboarding granted
# VMwareFusionCapable), and PLEIADES_WINARM_VM the VM's vmx path on the Mac. A run starts
# the VM when it is not running and suspends it when the run ends.
PLEIADES_WINARM_PROJECT=/home/you/pleiades-fusion-lab
PLEIADES_WINARM_DEVICE=win11-arm
PLEIADES_WINARM_VM_HOST=mac
PLEIADES_WINARM_VM=/Users/you/pleiades-vms/win11-arm/win11-arm.vmx
